 [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|baking soda]]\n* ½ teaspoon [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] white granulated [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 1 cup (236 ml) [[Cookbook:Soy Milk|soy milk]]\n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n* 2 teaspoons [[Cookbook:Vanilla|vanilla]]\n* 1 tablespoon apple [[Cookbook:Cider Vinegar|cider vinegar]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to {{convert|230|C|F}} and oil an 8-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] oven-safe [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]]. \n# Combine flour, baking powder, baking soda, salt, and sugar.\n# Add the soy milk, vegetable oil, and vanilla; stir well. \n# Stir in the apple cider vinegar, mix well, and pour immediately into the skillet. \n# [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at {{convert|230|C|F}} for 18 to 20 minutes, and serve.\n\n==Notes, tips, and variations==\n\n* When a [[Cookbook:Skewer|toothpick]] is inserted into the completed product, it should come out clean.\n[[Category:Breakfast recipes|Oven pancakes (vegan)]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pancakes|Oven, vegan]]\n[[Category:Vegan recipes|Oven pancakes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Baked recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking powder]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wheat flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Oven Pancakes (Vegan)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup (236 ml) flour","sourceText":"1 cup (236 ml) flour","amountText":"1 cup (236 ml) flour","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 teaspoons baking powder","sourceText":"2 teaspoons baking powder","amountText":"2 teaspoons baking powder","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ teaspoon baking soda","sourceText":"½ teaspoon baking soda","amountText":"½ teaspoon baki